# MAHARAJA SOAP CRM & ERP — environment reference
#
# This application is a self-contained front-end prototype. It calls no external
# API and holds no credentials, so NO environment variable is required to build,
# deploy or run it. The variables below only influence the local dev server and
# the asset base path; every one of them has a safe default in vite.config.ts.
#
# Never put real credentials in this file — it is committed to the repository.

# Base URL prefix applied to built asset paths. Leave unset for a normal
# deployment (Vercel, Netlify, static host) so assets resolve from the site root.
# FIGMA_PUBLIC_URL=

# Host the local dev/preview server binds to. Defaults to 0.0.0.0.
# FIGMA_DEV_SERVER_HOST=0.0.0.0

# Port the local dev/preview server listens on. Defaults to 8443.
# PORT=8443
